<p>The ending is confusing because we have to guess who's talking, and some of the ramblings of Scantron are bit too over the top for my taste, but otherwise, I love this slow descent into insanity. It's well paced, tragic, and it definitely scared me - but I'm a sucker for abstract and/or existential horror, so it helps.</p>
